| Self-correction during speaking | 14/56 | 25.00 | 29/56 | 51.79 |
| Voluntary reflection after speaking | 11/56 | 19.64 | 37/56 | 66.07 |

The results indicate increased frequencies of planning, monitoring, and reflection behaviors in the final observation phase compared with the early observation phase.

